<h1>Inject Some SQL - Rails 8 / Solid Cache</h1>
<p>
  This page lists Solid Cache / Solid Queue call patterns that do not bind
  user input and are not intended to be called with unsafe input. See
  <%= link_to "the README", "https://github.com/presidentbeef/inject-some-sql" %>
  for the rest of the examples across Rails versions.
</p>

<table>
  <% @queries.each do |q| %>
    <tr>
      <td><%= render partial: "query", locals: { query: q } %></td>
    </tr>
  <% end %>
</table>
